[[/jsxgraph]]
</div>
<p>On the unit circle, \(\sin x\) is the \(y\)-coordinate, so the solutions are the two points where the line \(y = {@k@}\) meets the circle.</p>
<div style="text-align:center;" role="img" aria-label="Unit circle with the horizontal line y = {#float(k)#} meeting the circle at two points, one for each solution.">
[[jsxgraph width="320px" height="320px"]]
